        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;VeryVeryHouse&quot; is an adventure game set in a strange house.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894150/extras/c48d4a920c404fcce27e84e96e39715b.avif?t=1761521181\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ <strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We moved into our new home, full of happiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We talked about little things, and laughed at little things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, strange things began happening around the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A staircase we didn’t know appeared in the hallway, and unfamiliar objects showed up in our rooms…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But even those unexpected surprises can be kind of fun sometimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story about us—and about a very strange house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894150/extras/38c17b96e6a8c934ba6184bc1eef37e9.avif?t=1761521181\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ <strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A walking simulator where various events occur as you explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress the story by examining objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No quest markers or time limits, allowing for a relaxed play experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about “me,” “you,” and “the house.”</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated playtime: 30 to 60 minutes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ <strong>Video Streaming Guidelines</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and organizations may stream the game without prior permission.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;VeryVeryHouse&quot; is an adventure game set in a strange house.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894150/extras/c48d4a920c404fcce27e84e96e39715b.avif?t=1761521181\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ <strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We moved into our new home, full of happiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We talked about little things, and laughed at little things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, strange things began happening around the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A staircase we didn’t know appeared in the hallway, and unfamiliar objects showed up in our rooms…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But even those unexpected surprises can be kind of fun sometimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story about us—and about a very strange house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894150/extras/38c17b96e6a8c934ba6184bc1eef37e9.avif?t=1761521181\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ <strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A walking simulator where various events occur as you explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress the story by examining objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No quest markers or time limits, allowing for a relaxed play experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about “me,” “you,” and “the house.”</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated playtime: 30 to 60 minutes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ <strong>Video Streaming Guidelines</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and organizations may stream the game without prior permission.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
